{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0ba143al","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":105,"top":145,"width":500,"height":430},"name":"intro-objectives","text":"Give students and job seekers repeatable, role-aware technical interview practice without depending on interviewer availability.\nUse a resume with a Job Description, or course material in Syllabus Mode, to select relevant interview topics.\nGenerate one question at a time, evaluate each answer, adapt the next question, and present structured feedback.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":17,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":650,"top":112,"width":465,"height":26},"name":"intro-right-heading","text":"Implemented approach and research background","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#0D5965","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ql8jytsj","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":650,"top":145,"width":465,"height":436},"name":"intro-implementation","text":"React user interface, FastAPI services, MySQL persistence, and ChromaDB semantic retrieval.\nSentenceTransformers all-MiniLM-L6-v2, Groq, edge-tts, and Groq Whisper support the current implementation.\nBase Paper 1: AI Mock Interview: An Intelligent Voice-Driven Interview Simulation System using Gemini AI and Whisper.\nBase Paper 2: Development of an Autonomous AI Interview Engine Using Sentence-BERT and Large Language Models for End-to-End Candidate Evaluation.\nThe papers motivate voice interaction, semantic matching, and adaptive interviewing. They are related work, not a claim that SmartInterview uses their Streamlit, Gemini, or Flask implementations.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jyx0ra1s","slideIndex":2,"text":"Sources: supplied BASE PAPER-INTERVIEW.pdf and BASE PAPER-INTERVIEW2.pdf; current repository README.md, backend/requirements.txt, and frontend/package.json."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/i107q5of","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/elwrupwj","name":"Blank"},"title":"REQUIREMENT","textShapes":6}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qd0bahob","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":92.7,"top":27.4,"width":1095,"height":54},"name":"section-title","text":"REQUIREMENT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#FF0000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dgbulwnm","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":105,"top":112,"width":490,"height":26},"name":"requirement-left-heading","text":"Expected application outcome","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#0D5965","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cf2tcr61","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":105,"top":145,"width":490,"height":430},"name":"expected-outcome","text":"Authenticated web application for technical mock interviews and performance review.\nNormal Mode: parse a PDF resume and Job Description, map matched and gap skills, then create an interview focus list.\nSyllabus Mode: ingest PDF, TXT, or DOCX course material and conduct a source-grounded adaptive interview.\nPersist interview sessions, questions, answers, evaluations, and user history for later review.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":17,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":650,"top":112,"width":465,"height":26},"name":"requirement-right-heading","text":"Major implemented features","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#0D5965","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":650,"top":145,"width":465,"height":430},"name":"feature-list","text":"Resume and Job Description upload with deterministic skill mapping and user-scoped records.\nRAG-based question generation from technical knowledge chunks before Groq receives the prompt.\nAdaptive Bloom's Taxonomy, difficulty, question type, and topic or skill selection.\nMulti-signal answer evaluation, results, history, performance dashboard, PDF reporting, and optional voice interaction.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":17,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l4bupwny","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":105,"top":606,"width":1000,"height":30},"name":"requirement-boundary","text":"Functional boundary: the system supports interview preparation and feedback. It does not claim recruitment ranking accuracy or deployment results from the base papers.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":14,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slideIndex":3,"text":"Implementation evidence: frontend/src/pages/ResumeUpload.jsx, SyllabusUpload.jsx, Interview.jsx, Results.jsx; backend/app/routers and services."}
