{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lsj6t47m","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":95,"top":588,"width":1040,"height":25},"name":"development-note","text":"Normal Mode uses the same embedding model and domain-filtered technical_kb retrieval for resume and Job Description selected skills. The adaptive engine advances above 80, maintains at 50-79, and regresses below 50.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":13,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":5,"text":"Implementation evidence: backend/app/services/syllabus_rag_service.py, question_service.py, adaptive_engine.py, evaluation_service.py, interview_service.py. Pipeline labels reflect source code: 1,000-character chunks, 200-character overlap, top 3 retrieval, SHA-256 exact deduplication, and distance <0.10 semantic filtering."}
