{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/elkf2pg7","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":92.7,"top":27.4,"width":1095,"height":54},"name":"section-title","text":"PROJECT OUTCOME","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#FF0000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/18byd4zy","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":75,"top":128,"width":330,"height":390},"name":"implemented-outcome","text":"Currently implemented\nTwo interview modes: Resume + Job Description and Syllabus Mode\n\nRAG-grounded questions with ChromaDB and all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n\nDeterministic Bloom and difficulty progression\n\nMulti-signal evaluations, result views, history, dashboard, and PDF report\n\nVoice: edge-tts and Groq Whisper","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#31859C","lineWidth":1.25,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#0D5965","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/g72x4zyd","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":450,"top":128,"width":330,"height":390},"name":"challenges","text":"Challenges observed\nQuestion generation, LLM evaluation, and speech transcription depend on Groq service availability.\n\nThe active syllabus mapping is process memory, so it does not survive a backend restart.\n\nThe repository contains no automated test suite.","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#E46C0A","lineWidth":1.25,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#E46C0A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ri9g7uhw","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":825,"top":128,"width":330,"height":390},"name":"improvements","text":"Improvement opportunities\nPersist active syllabus state in MySQL.\n\nAdd unit, integration, and end-to-end test coverage.\n\nAdd deployment, monitoring, and resilience work suitable for production use.\n\nEvaluate user outcomes with a defined study before making performance claims.","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#8A8A8A","lineWidth":1.25,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6h0fypgb","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":85,"top":560,"width":1040,"height":34},"name":"publication-status","text":"Publication status: the two supplied base papers are related work. No SmartInterview publication or patent is documented in the current repository.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fu1gfa1s","slideIndex":6,"text":"Implementation evidence: current repository source. Challenges are grounded in backend/app/services/interview_service.py, question_service.py, voice_service.py, and the absence of test files. Do not present base-paper results as SmartInterview results."}
