{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1cfmhgne","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":105,"top":116,"width":1000,"height":42},"name":"conclusion-summary","text":"SmartInterview combines a full-stack interview application with source-grounded RAG, deterministic adaptation, and persistent review data.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#0D5965","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0b65obm9","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":105,"top":178,"width":955,"height":290},"name":"conclusion-bullets","text":"RAG flow: source chunks become embeddings, ChromaDB retrieves similar content, and retrieved context grounds the Groq question prompt.\nMySQL stores user and interview relationships. ChromaDB stores semantic knowledge chunks for similarity retrieval.\nSyllabus Mode creates an isolated temporary knowledge base, uses it for the session, filters duplicate knowledge after completion, then removes the temporary collection.\nThe project developed practical skills in React, FastAPI, JWT, SQLAlchemy/MySQL, RAG, ChromaDB, SentenceTransformers, Groq, reporting, text-to-speech, and speech-to-text.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
